[2026-01-30T00:21:18.430Z] [STDOUT] {"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-5-20251101","id":"msg_01TQMvQa2cJbVLMoLzyFMwui","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"## Report Shell & Navigation - Insight Synth Complete ✓\n\n**Scan ID:** `424a94b7-ceea-40de-bb44-a503d2407fd2`\n\n**5 Ideas Created:**\n\n1. **Shell As Composable Layout Protocol** - The modal→shell→view hierarchy could be generalized into a LayoutProtocol where content declares its shell requirements (backdrop, animations, keyboard handlers) declaratively, inverting control from container to content.\n\n2. **Navigation As Addressable State Machine** - Elevate the flat activeTab state machine to a URL-addressable router with deep linking, back button support, and shareable positions (e.g., `report/123#findings?filter=high`).\n\n3. **Stats As Derived Views Not Props** - Replace prop drilling of stats with a `useReportStats(session)` hook that derives statistics anywhere they're needed, shifting from data flow to data availability.\n\n4. **Escape Handlers Are Global Keyboard Protocol** - The duplicate escape handlers in ReportShell and ReportModal reveal the need for a centralized KeyboardCommandContext with priority resolution, enabling command palette and shortcut customization.\n\n5. **Theme Duality Reveals Two Products In One** - RadarSidebar (surveillance/monitoring) and SwissSidebar (editorial/consumption) aren't just visual variants - they embody different user personas. The themes could diverge into distinct product modes with different feature sets.\n\n**Key Observation:** The shell/navigation layer is implicitly managing three orthogonal concerns - layout containment, state addressability, and keyboard input - that could be factored into separate, composable systems."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3550,"cache_read_input_tokens":74709,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3550},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"05d3e4f1-2259-4f3e-a055-8040a34c8b02","uuid":"54b5706e-97a4-43e1-be5a-9952864a116c"}
